---
import '../styles/site.css';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/,'');
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="description" content="Get help with the Masjidee pilot and share useful feedback without exposing private information."/><link rel="icon" href={`${base}/masjidee-mark.svg`}/><title>Help & feedback — Masjidee</title></head><body><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="header"><nav class="nav wrap" aria-label="Main navigation"><a class="brand" href={`${base}/`}><img src={`${base}/masjidee-mark.svg`} width="42" height="42" alt=""/>Masjidee</a><a class="text-link" href={`${base}/docs/`}>User guides →</a></nav></header><main id="main" class="article wrap"><a class="back" href={`${base}/`}>← Back to Masjidee</a><p class="eyebrow">A HELPING HAND</p><h1>We’re learning<br/><em>with you.</em></h1><p>Start with the <a href={`${base}/docs/guides/troubleshooting/`}>troubleshooting guide</a>. For account access, installation help, or private attendance information, contact your pilot organizer through the channel they used to invite you.</p><h2>Help us understand the problem</h2><ul><li>What were you trying to do, and what happened instead?</li><li>Which Masjidee version and Android phone/version are you using?</li><li>What exact error message appeared?</li><li>Can you reproduce it? If it concerns a time, include the date and timezone privately.</li></ul><div class="callout"><strong>Keep personal details private.</strong><p>Do not post passwords, account tokens, email addresses, attendance records, location history or screenshots containing personal information in public issues.</p></div><h2>Website and documentation feedback</h2><p>Found a typo, unclear guide or broken website link? <a href="https://github.com/saada1999/masjidee-site/issues/new">Open an issue in the public website repository</a>. A GitHub account is required. This is a public discussion, so share only information suitable for everyone to see.</p><h2>Prayer schedule corrections</h2><p>Contact your mosque’s administrator. Masjidee displays the calendars your mosque publishes; a website issue cannot correct congregation times.</p></main><footer class="footer wrap"><a href={`${base}/`}>Masjidee</a><nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href={`${base}/docs/`}>User guides</a><a href={`${base}/docs/guides/privacy/`}>Privacy & permissions</a></nav></footer></body></html>
